const assuranceDigest = "a73b6843b6fd1d5a205830faf50ebc1766c7003c64df269296a7330e086dd276"
const assuranceJSON = "{\"$schema\":\"banzami.validation.assurance/1\",\"invariants\":[{\"enforced_by\":\"database\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-001\",\"layer\":\"CHECK (environment = 'SANDBOX') — migration 0160\",\"proof\":\"tools/check-validation-run-model.mjs\",\"title\":\"A Validation Run against Live cannot be represented\",\"title_pt\":\"Uma execução contra o Live não pode sequer ser representada\",\"why\":\"REAL_LIVE_TESTS_EXECUTED=0 is a schema property rather than a policy. A run against Live is not discouraged or hidden behind a UI gate; there is no row that could hold one.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"database\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-002\",\"layer\":\"partial unique index validation_runs_one_active\",\"proof\":\"tools/check-validation-run-model.mjs\",\"title\":\"At most one Validation Run may hold the Sandbox\",\"title_pt\":\"No máximo uma execução detém o Sandbox\",\"why\":\"Two concurrent runs would spend the same rolling volume budget and interleave in the same nine actors' balances. Concurrency here is not a race to handle, it is a state to refuse.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"database\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-003\",\"layer\":\"trigger validation_runs_legal_transition\",\"proof\":\"tools/check-validation-run-model.mjs\",\"title\":\"Only declared state transitions are possible, and a terminal state is terminal\",\"title_pt\":\"Só transições declaradas são possíveis, e um estado terminal é terminal\",\"why\":\"A state machine that lives only in the process currently writing is one crash away from being untrue.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"database\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-004\",\"layer\":\"trigger validation_run_events_immutable + non-cascading foreign key\",\"proof\":\"tools/check-validation-run-model.mjs\",\"title\":\"A run's history is append-only, and a run cannot be deleted\",\"title_pt\":\"O histórico é append-only e uma execução não pode ser apagada\",\"why\":\"A run is evidence. Evidence that can be edited is not evidence, and evidence that can be deleted is a record of what someone chose to keep.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"application\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-005\",\"layer\":\"requireCompleteProvenance, inside the preparation transaction\",\"proof\":\"services/admin-api/internal/validation/store_test.go\",\"title\":\"A run cannot reach READY without complete mandatory provenance\",\"title_pt\":\"Sem proveniência obrigatória completa não há READY\",\"why\":\"A run whose provenance is missing is unattributable, and an unattributable result is worse than a known-stale one. Either the provenance rows and the READY transition both commit, or neither does.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"application\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-006\",\"layer\":\"BANZAMI_BUILD_COMMIT and GET /health .build\",\"proof\":\"services/admin-api/internal/validation/provenance_test.go\",\"title\":\"Provenance records the DEPLOYED revision, never the repository HEAD\",\"title_pt\":\"A proveniência regista a revisão IMPLANTADA, nunca o HEAD do repositório\",\"why\":\"The source tree and what is running are different things, and usually different commits. Substituting one for the other would silently re-describe what a run actually tested.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"application\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-007\",\"layer\":\"Actor carries credential NAMES only; measured is map[string]int64\",\"proof\":\"services/admin-api/internal/validation/registry_test.go\",\"title\":\"The Studio never holds a credential value or a secret reference\",\"title_pt\":\"O Studio nunca guarda o valor de uma credencial nem a sua referência\",\"why\":\"An operator needs to know that A01 has a TOTP seed registered. Knowing where that seed lives is a service nobody needs and a hint an attacker would take. The measured type makes a credential unassignable, so the compiler refuses before any redactor would.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"application\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-008\",\"layer\":\"read-only by construction, proven structurally against the source\",\"proof\":\"services/admin-api/internal/validation/preflight_test.go\",\"title\":\"The preflight consumes no quota\",\"title_pt\":\"A verificação prévia não consome quota\",\"why\":\"An operator must be able to ask whether the Sandbox is fit as often as they like without spending the budget the answer is about. Asserting afterwards that nothing changed cannot distinguish \\\"wrote nothing\\\" from \\\"wrote something idempotent\\\", so the guard reads the source instead.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"build\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-009\",\"layer\":\"pilot_gen.go, extracted from core/compliance/src/pilot{,_enforce}.rs\",\"proof\":\"tools/gen-pilot-limits.mjs --check\",\"title\":\"Headroom is measured with the enforcing engine's own definition\",\"title_pt\":\"A folga é medida com a definição do próprio motor que a impõe\",\"why\":\"A preflight that measured headroom differently from the engine that enforces it would clear a run the ledger then refuses halfway through — worse than no preflight at all.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"build\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-010\",\"layer\":\"tools/check-validation-execution-boundary.mjs\",\"proof\":\"tools/check-validation-execution-boundary.mjs\",\"title\":\"admin-api queues a run and never executes one\",\"title_pt\":\"O plano de controlo põe em fila; nunca executa\",\"why\":\"Until Phase D this invariant said no code path could START a run, and a guard enforced it so that adding a starter would be a deliberate act. It was: the owner authorised Phase D and the starter landed in the commit that deleted the guard. What remains, and always will, is the boundary — a request handler that runs a test suite times out halfway through one and leaves a run whose real state nobody knows. The control plane queues; the execution plane runs.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"application\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-011\",\"layer\":\"RBAC — validation.run is not held by COMPLIANCE\",\"proof\":\"services/admin-api/internal/server/validation_routes_test.go\",\"title\":\"Orchestration authority is separate from scenario authority\",\"title_pt\":\"Autoridade de orquestração é separada da autoridade de cenário\",\"why\":\"An actor that can schedule the validation it participates in is an actor whose PASS means less, because nothing outside the scenario decided the scenario should happen. See doc 31.\"},{\"enforced_by\":\"build\",\"id\":\"INV-VS-012\",\"layer\":\"check-validation-registries.mjs, cross-checked against suites.yaml\",\"proof\":\"tools/check-validation-registries.mjs\",\"title\":\"A profile may escalate a suite to blocking, never demote one\",\"title_pt\":\"Um perfil pode promover uma suite a bloqueante, nunca despromover\",\"why\":\"A profile must not be able to make a failing invariant stop counting.\"}],\"known_issues\":[{\"blocks_full\":false,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"24 suites are declared; one journey (S06-COL-001) is written. A GOLDEN or FULL run today would exercise almost nothing. The Studio reports suite implementation status so this cannot be mistaken for coverage.\",\"detail_pt\":\"24 suites estão declaradas; um percurso (S06-COL-001) está escrito. Uma execução GOLDEN ou FULL hoje não exerceria quase nada. O Studio reporta o estado de implementação de cada suite para que isto não possa ser confundido com cobertura.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-18\",\"id\":\"VD-001\",\"resolution\":\"37 journeys are registered across 23 of 24 suites. GOLDEN resolves to 12, every one backed by a harness that exists and asserts. The number this issue named is no longer true, so it is closed rather than left standing.\",\"resolved\":\"2026-09-19\",\"scope\":\"the whole validation universe\",\"severity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"title\":\"Only one journey is populated in the registry\",\"title_pt\":\"Só um percurso está populado no registo\"},{\"blocks_full\":true,\"blocks_golden\":true,\"detail\":\"Phase C deliberately builds the control surface and not the runner. No run can be started, and the guard INV-VS-010 keeps it that way until the decision is taken explicitly.\",\"detail_pt\":\"A Fase C constrói deliberadamente a superfície de controlo e não o motor. Nenhuma execução pode ser iniciada, e o guarda INV-VS-010 mantém-no assim até a decisão ser tomada explicitamente.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-18\",\"id\":\"VD-002\",\"scope\":\"execution\",\"severity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"No execution runner exists\",\"title_pt\":\"Não existe motor de execução\"},{\"blocks_full\":false,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"The first real prepared run predates C.10's provenance capture. It is preserved exactly, not backfilled: its incompleteness is the evidence that the defect was real. BZV-20260918-0002 carries full provenance.\",\"detail_pt\":\"A primeira execução realmente preparada é anterior à captura de proveniência do C.10. Fica preservada exactamente, sem preenchimento retroactivo: a sua incompletude é a evidência de que o defeito era real. A BZV-20260918-0002 já leva proveniência completa.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-18\",\"id\":\"VD-003\",\"scope\":\"one historical run\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"closed-historical\",\"title\":\"BZV-20260918-0001 has no provenance\",\"title_pt\":\"BZV-20260918-0001 não tem proveniência\"},{\"blocks_full\":false,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"The server mechanism is correct — a unique index on (environment, idempotency_key), and a replay returns the existing run untouched. But the key the UI generates changes every minute, so two clicks a minute apart create two runs instead of replaying one.\",\"detail_pt\":\"O mecanismo do servidor está correcto — índice único em (environment, idempotency_key), e um replay devolve a execução existente intacta. Mas a chave que a UI gera muda a cada minuto, por isso dois cliques com um minuto de intervalo criam duas execuções em vez de repetir uma.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-18\",\"id\":\"VD-004\",\"scope\":\"run preparation\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"The UI's idempotency key is derived from the minute\",\"title_pt\":\"A chave de idempotência da UI deriva do minuto\"},{\"blocks_full\":false,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"Proven pre-existing by stashing the entire Phase C change set: the identical six fail on the clean tree with the identical consumers_active_display_name_present error. Local test-database schema drift, not a product defect. Deliberately not repaired to produce a green report.\",\"detail_pt\":\"Provadas pré-existentes ao guardar todo o conjunto de alterações da Fase C: as mesmas seis falham na árvore limpa com o mesmo erro consumers_active_display_name_present. É deriva do esquema da base de dados de teste local, não um defeito do produto. Deliberadamente não reparadas para produzir um relatório verde.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-18\",\"id\":\"VD-005\",\"scope\":\"local test database only\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"Six pre-existing TestReceipt_* failures in api-gateway\",\"title_pt\":\"Seis falhas TestReceipt_* pré-existentes no api-gateway\"},{\"blocks_full\":false,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"Both predate Phase C and neither is on a Validation Studio path. Recorded rather than repaired: deploying a service to turn a parity line green is the substitution of appearance for correctness this programme exists to prevent.\",\"detail_pt\":\"Ambos são anteriores à Fase C e nenhum está num caminho do Validation Studio. Registados em vez de reparados: implantar um serviço para tornar verde uma linha de paridade é a substituição de aparência por correcção que este programa existe para impedir.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-18\",\"id\":\"VD-006\",\"scope\":\"unrelated components\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"developer-api and website-frontend diverge from the tree\",\"title_pt\":\"developer-api e website-frontend divergem da árvore\"},{\"blocks_full\":false,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"S14's binding half IS proven at runtime (S14-DOA-001, read-only). The donation half is not: doa-public-donation-e2e and webhook-delivery-to-doa WRITE into DOA's live tenant — DOA production runs on this Sandbox — and the donation harness additionally needs a human to complete an email OTP on www.doadoa.app plus caller-supplied PAY_SLUG, ACC_A and ACC_B. The blocker is consent and a human step, not engineering. The integration SHAPE (a platform taking a public payment, receiving a signed event, and a redelivery changing nothing) is proven against a synthetic tenant in S11 and S13; what is missing is that DOA SPECIFICALLY still works, which only DOA's owner can authorise for a named window.\",\"detail_pt\":\"A metade da ligação do S14 ESTÁ provada em execução (S14-DOA-001, só-leitura). A metade da doação não: dois harnesses ESCREVEM no inquilino real do DOA — a produção do DOA corre neste Sandbox — e o da doação exige ainda que uma pessoa complete um código enviado por email em www.doadoa.app, mais três identificadores fornecidos por quem chama. O impedimento é consentimento e um passo humano, não engenharia. A FORMA da integração está provada com um inquilino sintético em S11 e S13; o que falta é que o DOA ESPECIFICAMENTE continua a funcionar, e só o dono do DOA pode autorizar isso para uma janela nomeada.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-19\",\"id\":\"VD-007\",\"scope\":\"S14 — the donation flow, not the binding\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"DOA's donation flow cannot be proven without the third party's authorisation\",\"title_pt\":\"O fluxo de doação do DOA não é provável sem autorização do terceiro\"},{\"blocks_full\":true,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"S19-DOC-001 is registered EXECUTABLE on an adapter proven only against fixtures: the three report shapes, the reconciliation, and PENDING/NOT_RUN never counting as a pass. That is exactly how phase0-stdout looked finished while the runner could not start a phase-0 harness at all — no fixture can discover a missing staged dependency, and none did. quickstart-e2e costs one application-submit slot and moves money, and the current window is reserved for the GOLDEN acceptance run and its retry, so this is recorded rather than spent. It does not block GOLDEN (S19 is not in it) and it does block FULL until the adapter has read one real report.\",\"detail_pt\":\"O S19-DOC-001 está registado como EXECUTÁVEL com base num adaptador provado apenas contra fixtures. Foi exactamente assim que o adaptador shell pareceu terminado enquanto o executor nem conseguia arrancar um harness — nenhuma fixture descobre uma dependência que falta no envio. Correr o harness real custa uma candidatura e move dinheiro, e a janela actual está reservada para a execução GOLDEN e a sua repetição. Não bloqueia o GOLDEN; bloqueia o FULL até o adaptador ter lido um relatório real.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-19\",\"id\":\"VD-008\",\"scope\":\"S19 — the only journey that uses it\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"The assurance-json adapter has never run against a real harness\",\"title_pt\":\"O adaptador assurance-json nunca correu contra um harness real\"},{\"blocks_full\":true,\"blocks_golden\":false,\"detail\":\"With every journey now declaring max_synthetic_funds_exposure_minor, FULL's no-cleanup upper bound is 56 950 000 minor against a shared cap of 50 000 000 — and the start gate, which must also survive a failed run plus one retry, needs 113 900 000. FULL is therefore feasible ONLY because cleanup works, and that dependency was invisible while the planner reported a heuristic 4 500 000. GOLDEN is unaffected: 14 500 000 peak, 29 000 000 required, and the headroom exists. The fix is not a larger cap. It is for the runner to VERIFY cleanup after each journey and abort when residual accumulates, so the bound that matters becomes the per-journey maximum rather than the sum — which is a real change to how a FULL run is governed, not a number to adjust.\",\"detail_pt\":\"Com todos os percursos a declarar a sua exposição máxima, o limite superior do FULL sem qualquer limpeza é 56 950 000 minor contra um tecto partilhado de 50 000 000 — e o portão de arranque, que tem de sobreviver a uma execução falhada mais uma repetição, exige 113 900 000. O FULL só é viável PORQUE a limpeza funciona, e essa dependência estava invisível enquanto o planeador reportava uns heurísticos 4 500 000. O GOLDEN não é afectado. A correcção não é um tecto maior: é o executor verificar a limpeza depois de cada percurso e abortar quando fica resíduo.\",\"first_observed\":\"2026-09-19\",\"id\":\"VD-009\",\"scope\":\"S-all — FULL readiness, not GOLDEN\",\"severity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"open\",\"title\":\"FULL's upper-bound funded exposure exceeds the Sandbox cap\",\"title_pt\":\"O limite superior de fundos do FULL excede o tecto do Sandbox\"}],\"registry_version\":1}"

